      'yea_supports', 'Second substitute text creates the Utah Commission for Earthquake Preparedness with named membership, quorum and staffing from the Department of Natural Resources, assigns it preparedness duties, and makes its appropriations nonlapsing until a 2031 sunset. Standing state capacity for earthquake preparedness is exactly what this key measures, though a commission is a step short of a mitigation program.', 'https://le.utah.gov/Session/2025/bills/introduced/HB0513S02.xml');
